    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MemOrb: A Plug-and-Play Verbal-Reinforcement Memory Layer for E-Commerce Customer Service
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Huang%2C+Y">Yizhe Huang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+Y">Yang Liu</a>, 
      
